    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544990/extras/ab8b2f12d305fed12fe38777ddfa8667.webp?t=1748335296\" /></span><br>The protagonist is a poker player who only cares about playing cards, and he has always been single. On his 30th birthday, he received a magical card that could hypnotize other girls. As a card player, what does he want to use this ability for?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544990/extras/5e9154e986203e9d640fc188204b8a22.webp?t=1748335296\" /></span><br>&quot;Hypnosis Card&quot; is a card battle game centered around deck building, which introduces a <strong>body part</strong> concept. Players have access to many cards from five major genres. Encounter various events on randomly generated maps, develop the plot, and have exciting battles with cute girls.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544990/extras/ccf425f3fb74abe397d6a1f403a114ee.webp?t=1748335296\" /></span><br><strong>Kanome Shinichi</strong><br>The younger sister brought here by my stepmother. She likes sports and good at both morals and academics. She is friendly to others, and is very popular. But in fact, he hates any boy who comes close to her, and she is especially cold towards me.<br>Measurements: 82 58 88<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544990/extras/91c8245fd3b55772e38e65ce2e51d227.poster.avif?t=1748335296\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544990/extras/91c8245fd3b55772e38e65ce2e51d227.webm?t=1748335296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Kasuga Nana</strong><br>The top maid in the maid caf\u00e9. Always dressed as a cat. She is cute and enthusiastic and is the pillar of my soul. She is so popular with guests that sometimes it's difficult to name her for service.<br>Measurements: 98 62 92<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544990/extras/3bebc57fb61f6f3cfc728f3b56c946a5.poster.avif?t=1748335296\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544990/extras/3bebc57fb61f6f3cfc728f3b56c946a5.webm?t=1748335296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544990/extras/a9b303ffbe3a1026972c64e47aa60f22.webp?t=1748335296\" /></span><br>\u2764 5 beautiful girls<br>There are 5 different girls to encounter in the game!<br><br>\u2764 Dynamically changing map<br>Maps are randomly generated, and each experience is completely different.<br><br>\u2764 Random mysterious events<br>Have many mysterious events, trigger plots or powerful cards? It all depends on your choice.<br><br>\u2764 Rich cards and combinations<br>Customizable decks to form different strategies!",
